OL,3,GNEWSAMinister and family targeted with
OL,4,Aonline abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government minister has told the
OL,7,FJersey's States Assembly he and his
OL,8,Ffamily have been targeted with abuse
OL,9,Fonline after he made comments on
OL,10,Fworkers' rights.
OL,12,FDeputy Gerald Voisin told business
OL,13,Fleaders and the BBC last week that
OL,14,Fimproving rights for workers might have
OL,15,Fto take "second place" if it were to
OL,16,Fslow economic growth.
OL,18,FBut, following a backlash, the economic
OL,19,Fdevelopment head stood on Tuesday to
OL,20,Fspeak to the assembly and denied
OL,21,Faccusations his comments were
OL,22,Finflammatory.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
