OL,3,GNEWSAMinister and family targeted with
OL,4,Aonline abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoisin said "a small section" of the
OL,7,Fcommunity was seeking to "whip up a
OL,8,Ffrenzy" against him on social media,
OL,9,Fand that it had even led to his wife
OL,10,Freceiving abusive phone calls.
